     1962   if available out-vatp_gds-dtlcl then do:
     1963     find first buf_out-vatp_gds-dtlcl where buf_out-vatp_gds-dtlcl.doc-code  =  pardoc-code                and
     1964                                              buf_out-vatp_gds-dtlcl.artic     =  parartic                   and
